---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="给阿嬷的情书" description="电影《给阿嬷的情书》幕后花絮珍藏站">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="letter-envelope fade-in">
      <div class="wax-seal"></div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">给阿嬷的情书</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">幕后珍藏站 · 信的背面</p>
      <p class="hero-quote">
        "两个素未谋面的女子，在海的两边，<br>
        因为有一样的人生信念，隔空支撑了对方的一生。"
      </p>

      <nav class="nav-letters">
        <a href="/gallery/timeline" class="nav-letter fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <div class="nav-letter-number">展厅一</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-title">时间线</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-desc">
            从1930到2018<br>
            跨越近百年的人生轨迹
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/gallery/people" class="nav-letter fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <div class="nav-letter-number">展厅二</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-title">那些人</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-desc">
            从各自生活走来<br>
            与角色相遇的入戏时刻
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/gallery/story" class="nav-letter fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
          <div class="nav-letter-number">展厅三</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-title">那些事</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-desc">
            象征物解读与剧情解析<br>
            观众常问问题
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/gallery/behind-the-scenes" class="nav-letter fade-in fade-in-delay-4">
          <div class="nav-letter-number">展厅四</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-title">那些片场</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-desc">
            被剪掉的光影与倒推的遗憾<br>
            未散的片场余温
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/gallery/letters" class="nav-letter fade-in">
          <div class="nav-letter-number">展厅五</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-title">那些信</div>
          <div class="nav-letter-desc">
            电影中每一封侨批<br>
            信面、信背与创作解读
          </div>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
      <p>所有内容来自剧组一手采访 · 路演 · 节目 · 杂志</p>
      <p class="footer-note">《给阿嬷的情书》DEAR YOU · 蓝鸿春导演作品</p>
    </footer>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
